IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `wmd-rules`

-- Weapons of Mass Destruction (Prevention of Proliferation) Act 1995 (Cth) —
-- the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`supply` MEANS `supplying goods to another person`
`home` MEANS `acting in Australia or an external Territory`

GIVEN dl IS A `Dealing`, w IS A `Who and where`, suspect IS A BOOLEAN, permit IS A BOOLEAN, allclear IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `WMD case`
`a dealing` dl `by` w `suspecting` suspect `permitted` permit `cleared` allclear MEANS
    `WMD case` OF dl, w, suspect, permit, allclear, `no notice`, FALSE, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, Date 1 3 2026

-- ss 9-11
#ASSERT `the ss 9-11 offence` (`a dealing` `supply` `by` `home` `suspecting` TRUE `permitted` FALSE `cleared` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the ss 9-11 offence` (`a dealing` `supply` `by` `home` `suspecting` FALSE `permitted` FALSE `cleared` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the ss 9-11 offence` (`a dealing` `supply` `by` `home` `suspecting` TRUE `permitted` TRUE `cleared` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the ss 9-11 offence` (`a dealing` `supply` `by` `home` `suspecting` TRUE `permitted` FALSE `cleared` TRUE))
#ASSERT `the ss 9-11 offence` (`a dealing` `providing services to another person` `by` `abroad, an Australian citizen, resident or body incorporated in Australia` `suspecting` TRUE `permitted` FALSE `cleared` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the ss 9-11 offence` (`a dealing` `providing services to another person` `by` `abroad, anyone else` `suspecting` TRUE `permitted` FALSE `cleared` FALSE))
#ASSERT (`the WMD position for` (`a dealing` `supply` `by` `home` `suspecting` TRUE `permitted` FALSE `cleared` FALSE))'s `maximum imprisonment in years` EQUALS 8
-- s 17
#ASSERT `the goods are forfeited` (`a dealing` `exporting goods that are not prohibited exports under the Customs Act` `by` `home` `suspecting` TRUE `permitted` FALSE `cleared` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the goods are forfeited` (`a dealing` `providing services to another person` `by` `home` `suspecting` TRUE `permitted` FALSE `cleared` FALSE))
-- s 14: a conditional notice given 1 June 2025, complied with: no offence.
#ASSERT NOT (`the ss 9-11 offence` (`WMD case` OF `supply`, `home`, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, `a notice allowing it only on conditions`, TRUE, FALSE, JUST (Date 1 6 2025), FALSE, Date 1 3 2026))
-- s 14(6): knowingly contravening a prohibiting notice
#ASSERT `the s 14 offence` (`WMD case` OF `supply`, `home`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a notice prohibiting the dealing`, FALSE, TRUE, JUST (Date 1 6 2025), FALSE, Date 1 3 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`the s 14 offence` (`WMD case` OF `supply`, `home`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a notice prohibiting the dealing`, FALSE, FALSE, JUST (Date 1 6 2025), FALSE, Date 1 3 2026))
-- s 14(4): in force to 31 May 2026; not on 1 June 2026; not if revoked.
#ASSERT `the notice end for` (`WMD case` OF `supply`, `home`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a notice prohibiting the dealing`, FALSE, TRUE, JUST (Date 1 6 2025), FALSE, Date 1 3 2026) EQUALS JUST (Date 31 5 2026)
#ASSERT `the s 14 offence` (`WMD case` OF `supply`, `home`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a notice prohibiting the dealing`, FALSE, TRUE, JUST (Date 1 6 2025), FALSE, Date 31 5 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`the s 14 offence` (`WMD case` OF `supply`, `home`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a notice prohibiting the dealing`, FALSE, TRUE, JUST (Date 1 6 2025), FALSE, Date 1 6 2026))
#ASSERT NOT (`the s 14 offence` (`WMD case` OF `supply`, `home`, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a notice prohibiting the dealing`, FALSE, TRUE, JUST (Date 1 6 2025), TRUE, Date 1 3 2026))
